# Added by `vercel link`. The CLI also appended `.env*`, which was removed: it
# sits after the `!.env.example` negation above and the last matching pattern
# wins, so it silently re-ignored the file this project treats as the env
# contract. Harmless while the file stays tracked, and a trap the moment
# someone re-adds it.
.vercel

